@Logic
script WorldShopPurchaseLogic extends Logic

	-- 등록 후 { productId = "실제 상품 ID", diamondAmount = 지급량, isSaleEnabled = true } 항목 추가
	-- 지급량 변경은 새 상품 ID 사용, 판매 종료 항목은 false로 보존하여 미처리 구매 복구
	property any packageDefinitions = {
		{ productId = "8MNUV3CJJ", diamondAmount = 100, isSaleEnabled = true },
		{ productId = "1YKYKNU7K", diamondAmount = 1, isSaleEnabled = true },
		{ productId = "ESDUMQR4Q", diamondAmount = 7, isSaleEnabled = true },
		{ productId = "QGIAKJ1ZL", diamondAmount = 15, isSaleEnabled = true },
		{ productId = "DGKB4ZV6Q", diamondAmount = 30, isSaleEnabled = true },
		{ productId = "13Z67133H", diamondAmount = 50, isSaleEnabled = true }
	}
	property any tPackagesByProductId = {}
	property any requestedAtByUserId = {}
	property any processPurchaseCallback = nil
	property boolean isCatalogValid = false
	property number lastClientRequestAt = -10
	property string STATUS_READY = "ready"
	property string STATUS_PAYMENT_COMPLETED = "payment_completed"
	property string STATUS_DELIVERY_PENDING = "delivery_pending"
	property string STATUS_PROMPT_FAILED = "prompt_failed"
	property string STATUS_INVALID_PRODUCT = "invalid_product"
	property string STATUS_WALLET_UNAVAILABLE = "wallet_unavailable"
	property string STATUS_PRODUCT_UNAVAILABLE = "product_unavailable"
	property string STATUS_THROTTLED = "throttled"

	@ExecSpace("ServerOnly")
	method void OnBeginPlay()
		-- 월드 세션 시작 시 플랫폼 구매 콜백 등록
		self.requestedAtByUserId = {}
		self:BuildCatalog()
		self.processPurchaseCallback = function(purchaseInfo) return self:ProcessPurchase(purchaseInfo) end
		_WorldShopService:SetProcessPurchaseCallback(self.processPurchaseCallback)
	end

	@ExecSpace("ServerOnly")
	method boolean BuildCatalog()
		-- 중복 상품 ID나 비정상 설정이 있으면 신규 지급 전체 차단
		self.tPackagesByProductId = {}
		self.isCatalogValid = false
		if type(self.packageDefinitions) ~= "table" then return false end
		for _, tPlainData in ipairs(self.packageDefinitions) do
			local tPackage = DiamondPackageData()
			if tPackage:FromPlainTable(tPlainData) == false or self.tPackagesByProductId[tPackage.productId] ~= nil then
				log_error("[WorldShop] invalid or duplicate diamond package definition")
				self.tPackagesByProductId = {}
				return false
			end
			self.tPackagesByProductId[tPackage.productId] = tPackage
		end
		self.isCatalogValid = true
		return true
	end

	@ExecSpace("ServerOnly")
	method boolean ProcessPurchase(any purchaseInfo)
		-- UI 성공 통지 대신 플랫폼 구매 콜백으로만 지급, 내구 저장 완료 시에만 true 반환
		if purchaseInfo == nil then return false end
		local tPackage = self.isCatalogValid and self.tPackagesByProductId[purchaseInfo.ProductId] or nil
		-- 상품 설정이 없어도 이전에 지급한 구매 ID는 지갑에서 중복 처리 완료 판정
		local amount = tPackage ~= nil and tPackage.diamondAmount or 0
		local success = _DiamondWalletLogic:TryProcessPurchase(purchaseInfo, amount)
		if success == false then
			log_warning("[WorldShop] purchase remains pending id=" .. tostring(purchaseInfo.PurchaseId)
				.. " product=" .. tostring(purchaseInfo.ProductId))
		end
		if tPackage ~= nil and isvalid(_UserService:GetUserEntityByUserId(purchaseInfo.UserId)) then
			self:ReceivePurchaseCompletion(purchaseInfo.ProductId, success, purchaseInfo.UserId)
		end
		return success
	end

	@ExecSpace("ClientOnly")
	method boolean BeginPurchase(string productId, string requestId)
		-- 확정될 구매 UI에서 호출할 상품 ID 기반 진입점
		if type(productId) ~= "string" or productId == "" then return false end
		local now = _UtilLogic.ElapsedSeconds
		if now - self.lastClientRequestAt < 2 then return false end
		self.lastClientRequestAt = now
		self:RequestBeginPurchase(productId, requestId)
		return true
	end

	@ExecSpace("ClientOnly")
	method table ClientGetPackageDefinitions()
		-- 구매 UI가 표시할 설정 복사본 반환, 실제 가격은 WorldShopService 상품 조회 사용
		local result = {}
		for _, tPlainData in ipairs(self.packageDefinitions) do
			local tPackage = DiamondPackageData()
			if tPackage:FromPlainTable(tPlainData) and tPackage.isSaleEnabled then
				table.insert(result, tPackage:ToPlainTable())
			end
		end
		return result
	end

	@ExecSpace("Server")
	method void RequestBeginPurchase(string productId, string requestId)
		-- 요청자 지갑과 등록 상품을 확인한 뒤 해당 클라이언트에 결제 창 열기 허용
		if not isvalid(_UserService:GetUserEntityByUserId(senderUserId)) or #requestId > 60 or requestId == "" then return end
		local now = _UtilLogic.ElapsedSeconds
		local previous = self.requestedAtByUserId[senderUserId]
		if previous ~= nil and now - previous < 2 then
			self:ReceivePurchaseRequestResult(productId, self.STATUS_THROTTLED, requestId, senderUserId)
			return
		end
		self.requestedAtByUserId[senderUserId] = now
		local tPackage = self.isCatalogValid and self.tPackagesByProductId[productId] or nil
		if tPackage == nil or tPackage.isSaleEnabled == false then
			self:ReceivePurchaseRequestResult(productId, self.STATUS_INVALID_PRODUCT, requestId, senderUserId)
			return
		end
		if _UserDataManager.isResetInProgress or _DiamondWalletLogic:LoadForUser(senderUserId) == false then
			self:ReceivePurchaseRequestResult(productId, self.STATUS_WALLET_UNAVAILABLE, requestId, senderUserId)
			return
		end
		local ok, product = pcall(function() return _WorldShopService:GetProductAndWait(productId) end)
		if ok == false or product == nil or product.Id ~= productId or product.Type ~= WorldShopProductType.Item then
			self:ReceivePurchaseRequestResult(productId, self.STATUS_PRODUCT_UNAVAILABLE, requestId, senderUserId)
			return
		end
		self:ReceivePurchaseRequestResult(productId, self.STATUS_READY, requestId, senderUserId)
	end

	@ExecSpace("Client")
	method void ReceivePurchaseRequestResult(string productId, string status, string requestId)
		-- 닫혔거나 시간이 지난 요청은 플랫폼 창을 열지 않음
		if not _PurchaseUILogic:CanAcceptAuthorization(productId, requestId) then return end
		self:SendPurchaseStatus(productId, status)
		if status == self.STATUS_READY then
			local ok = pcall(function() _WorldShopService:PromptPurchase(productId) end)
			if not ok then self:SendPurchaseStatus(productId, self.STATUS_PROMPT_FAILED) end
		end
	end

	@ExecSpace("Client")
	method void ReceivePurchaseCompletion(string productId, boolean success)
		-- 서버 지갑의 확정 지급 결과만 전달
		self:SendPurchaseStatus(productId, success and self.STATUS_PAYMENT_COMPLETED or self.STATUS_DELIVERY_PENDING)
	end

	@ExecSpace("ClientOnly")
	method void SendPurchaseStatus(string productId, string status)
		local event = WorldShopPurchaseRequestEvent()
		event.productId = productId
		event.status = status
		self:SendEvent(event)
	end

	@ExecSpace("ServerOnly")
	method void OnEndPlay()
		-- 종료 중 새 구매 지급 차단 및 콜백 참조 해제
		_WorldShopService:SetProcessPurchaseCallback(function(purchaseInfo) return false end)
		self.processPurchaseCallback = nil
		self.tPackagesByProductId = {}
		self.requestedAtByUserId = {}
		self.isCatalogValid = false
	end

end
